{"4149010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doubtbound", "steam_appid": 4149010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doubtbound is a turn-based RPG about trust, strategy and hidden betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally a party of 3 to 5 and set out to overthrow the Mad Monarch. Choose cards that shape the encounters ahead, fight through dangerous trials, build your hero with powerful abilities and decide who receives the loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/2d64c6d696c4ecc7ae2386dd37a1c86c.poster.avif?t=1786453526\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/2d64c6d696c4ecc7ae2386dd37a1c86c.webm?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/2d64c6d696c4ecc7ae2386dd37a1c86c.mp4?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone in your party is working against you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One party member secretly serves the Mad Monarch and can sabotage the journey from within. Pay attention to the cards they choose, the decisions they make and who they help along the way. Expose the traitor before the final confrontation or face the Monarch at full strength.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play With Friends or Bots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Doubt Bound, play online with friends, fill empty seats with bots, or take a full bot party on your own. The complete hidden betrayal experience remains playable regardless of how many friends are available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based RPG combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards that shape each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden traitor and sabotage mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party votes and loot decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes with different abilities and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online parties of 3 to 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots for empty seats or solo play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable runs with changing encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylised 2D characters in a colourful 3D diorama world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/8a8a702d98632a0dc9323f410ba670a1.poster.avif?t=1786453526\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/8a8a702d98632a0dc9323f410ba670a1.webm?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/8a8a702d98632a0dc9323f410ba670a1.mp4?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doubtbound is a turn-based RPG about trust, strategy and hidden betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally a party of 3 to 5 and set out to overthrow the Mad Monarch. Choose cards that shape the encounters ahead, fight through dangerous trials, build your hero with powerful abilities and decide who receives the loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/2d64c6d696c4ecc7ae2386dd37a1c86c.poster.avif?t=1786453526\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/2d64c6d696c4ecc7ae2386dd37a1c86c.webm?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/2d64c6d696c4ecc7ae2386dd37a1c86c.mp4?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone in your party is working against you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One party member secretly serves the Mad Monarch and can sabotage the journey from within. Pay attention to the cards they choose, the decisions they make and who they help along the way. Expose the traitor before the final confrontation or face the Monarch at full strength.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play With Friends or Bots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Doubt Bound, play online with friends, fill empty seats with bots, or take a full bot party on your own. The complete hidden betrayal experience remains playable regardless of how many friends are available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based RPG combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards that shape each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden traitor and sabotage mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party votes and loot decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes with different abilities and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online parties of 3 to 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots for empty seats or solo play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable runs with changing encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylised 2D characters in a colourful 3D diorama world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/8a8a702d98632a0dc9323f410ba670a1.poster.avif?t=1786453526\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/8a8a702d98632a0dc9323f410ba670a1.webm?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/extras/8a8a702d98632a0dc9323f410ba670a1.mp4?t=1786453526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A turn-based RPG of hidden betrayal. Battle through branching encounters, uncover the traitor within your party, and overthrow the Mad Monarch in multiplayer or solo investigation mode.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/8cb65c615892dc6c7a6013423fe34e2ea5792e7e/header.jpg?t=1786453526", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/4f048698267be4d352d339bab0d4e0b4ca2e777f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786453526", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149010/4f048698267be4d352d339bab0d4e0b4ca2e777f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786453526", "website": "https://linktr.ee/doubtbound", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-1135G7 or AMD Ryzen 5 4500U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Xe Graphics or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-b